caption: Insight and Flourishes
tradition-component: insight-and-flourishes

A Low Mage may realize Insight through the Flourish engine. When spending Insight for Precision on a Low Magic spell, treat the +5 effective skill as one additional Flourish for purposes of that casting's Flourish total. This is not a separate Insight benefit and still counts as the one Insight that may normally be spent on the effect.
